      "implementation": "Git --no-replace-objects and child-only GIT_NO_REPLACE_OBJECTS; compare every actual tracked file/blob hash and executable mode with the real pinned tree before imports; reject root/ancestor/leaf aliases. No user Git configuration changed.",
      "evidence": "Actual frozen host (112 tracked files) and two public source roots checked; synthetic A→B replacement fixture reports normal HEAD=A/status clean but hostModule rejects B before executing it; restored real A imports while replace ref remains present. assume-unchanged bytes also rejected."
